")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            You understand that we are acting solely as an intermediary for the collection of rents and fees between a SERVICE USER and a Service Provider who choose to enter into an Agreement for Service. Because state and local tax laws vary significantly by locality, you understand and agree that you are solely responsible for determining your own tax reporting requirements in consultation with tax advisors, and that we cannot and do not offer tax advice to either hosts or guests. Further, you understand that Sheba.xyz shall not be responsible or liable in any manner in relation to tax liability of a SERVICE USER or a SERVICE PROVIDER.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("\n            3. REFUND POLICY\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            Service fees provided by Client to Service Provider or SHEBA.xyz are final and non-refundable. But in some cases SHEBA.xyz support management team can take some decisions, if any investigation report find any issues like\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("ol",{staticClass:"1"},[s("li",[e._v("\n              Client fully paid for certain job but job canceled due to others issues.\n            ")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v("\n              Job has been served and customer cleared the bill. But dispute arises within warranty period\n            ")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v("\n              Client paid in advance but job served in less amount.\n            ")])]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            In case of refund SHEBA.xyz promo code will be provided to customer for availing services.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h3",{staticClass:"secondary-header"},[e._v("\n            k. Negotiation of Terms of Service; Disputes Between Registered Users\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("hr")]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("\n            1. SHEBA.XYZ IS NOT A PARTY TO ANY SERVICE CONTRACT\n          ")]),e._v