ire.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("4. SHEBA.XYZ'S DISCLAIMERS AND RIGHT TO REMOVE")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            1. Sheba.xyz does not endorse any Submitted Content or any opinion, recommendation, or advice expressed therein, and Sheba.xyz expressly disclaims any and all liability in connection with all Submitted Content. Sheba.xyz does not permit copyright infringing activities and infringement of intellectual property rights on the Website, and Sheba.xyz will remove any Data (as defined below) or Submitted Content if properly notified, pursuant to the \"take down\" notification procedure described in Section J below, that such Posting or Submitted Content infringes on another's intellectual property rights. Sheba.xyz reserves the right to remove any Data or Submitted Content without prior notice. Sheba.xyz will also terminate a user's access to the Website, if he or she is determined to be a repeat infringer. A repeat infringer is a Website user who has been notified of infringing activity more than twice and/ or has had Submitted Content removed from the Website more than twice. Sheba.xyz also reserves the right, in its sole and absolute discretion, to decide whether any Data or Submitted Content is appropriate and complies with these Terms of Use for all violations, in addition to copyright infringement and violations of intellectual property law, including, but not limited to, pornography, obscene or defamatory material, or excessive length. Sheba.xyz may remove such Submitted Content and/or terminate a user's access for uploading such material in violation of these Terms of Use at any time, without prior notice and in its sole discretion.\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            2. You acknowledge and understand that when using the Website, you will be exposed to Submitted Content from a variety of sources, and that Sheba.xyz is not responsible for the accuracy, usefulness, safety, or intelle