z owns and retains all rights in the Sheba.xyz Data and Marks. Subject to these Terms of Use, Sheba.xyz hereby grants you a limited, revocable, nontransferable, nonsublicensable license to reproduce and display the Sheba.xyz Data (excluding any software source code) solely for your personal use in connection with accessing and participating in the Website.\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            The Website may also contain Data of other users or licensors, which you shall not copy, modify, translate, publish, broadcast, transmit, distribute, perform, display, or sell.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h3",{staticClass:"secondary-header"},[e._v("J. Sheba.xyz Fees")]),e._v(" "),s("hr")]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("1. FEES INCURRED BY SERVICE USERS")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            Joining Sheba.xyz, opening an Account, viewing posted Services is free. Sheba.xyz currently does not charge SERVICE USERs for transactions completed on the SHEBA.XYZ Product between SERVICE USERs and Services Professionals. However, Sheba.xyz reserves the right to charge a fee to SERVICE USERs in the future on a per-transaction basis or in any other manner, and reserves the right to do so in its sole discretion. Changes to this Fee Policy are effective after Sheba.xyz has provided you with thirty (30) days' notice by posting the changes on the Terms & Condition\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            If applicable, you agree to pay all fees or charges to your Account based on Sheba.xyz's fees, charges, and billing terms then in effect. If you do not pay on time or if Sheba.xyz cannot charge your credit card, any payment gateway or other payment method for any reason, Sheba.xyz reserves the right to either suspend or terminate your access to the Website and Account and terminate these Terms of Use. You are expressly agreeing that Sheba.xyz is permitted to bill you for the applicable fees, any applicable tax and any other charges you may incur in connection with your use of this Website and the fees will be billed to your credit card, a payment gateway or other payment method designated at the time you make a purchase or register for a fee-based service. If you cancel your Account at any time, you will not receive any refund. If you have a balance due on any account, you agree that Sheba.xyz may charge such unpaid fees to your credit card or otherwise bill you for such unpaid fees. Sheba.xyz reserves its right to initiate appropriate legal proceedings, if necessary, in its sole discretion, to recover such outstanding amounts.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("\n            2. TAXES\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            You understand that we are acting solely as an intermediary for the collection of rents and fees between a SERVICE USER and a Service Provider who choose to enter into an Agreement for Service. Because state and local tax laws vary significantly by locality, you understand and agree that you are solely responsible for determining your own tax reporting requirements in consultation with tax advisors, and that we cannot and do not offer tax advice to either hosts or guests. Further, you understand that Sheba.xyz shall not be responsible or liable in any manner in relation to tax liability of a SERVICE USER or a SERVICE PROVIDER.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("\n            3. REFUND POLICY\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            Service fees provided by Client to Service Provider or SHEBA.xyz are final and non-refundable. But in some cases SHEBA.xyz support management team can take some decisions, if any investigation report find any issues like\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("ol",{staticClass:"1"},[s("li",[e._v("\n              Client fully paid for certain job but job canceled due to others issues.\n            ")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v("\n              Job has been served and customer cleared the bill. But dispute arises within warranty period\n            ")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v("\n              Client paid in advance but job served in less amount.\n            ")])]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            In case of refund SHEBA.xyz promo code will be provided to customer for availing services.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h3",{staticClass:"secondary-header"},[e._v("\n            k. Negotiation of Terms of Service; Disputes Between Registered Users\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("hr")]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("\n            1. SHEBA.XYZ IS NOT A PARTY TO ANY SERVICE CONTRACT\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            Each Registered User hereby acknowledges and agrees that Sheba.xyz is NOT a party to any oral or written Agreement for Service, Negotiation Worksheet, or any contract entered into between Registered Users in connection with any Service offered, directly or indirectly, through the Website. Each Registered User acknowledges, agrees and understands that Sheba.xyz only seeks to provide a platform wherein the SERVICE USER and SERVICE PROVIDER can be brought together and Sheba.xyz itself has not role in the execution or provision of Services.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("2. NO AGENCY OR PARTNERSHIP")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            No agency, partnership, joint venture, or employment is created as a result of the Terms of Use or your use of any part of the Website, including without limitation, the Negotiation Worksheet or Agreement for Service. You do not have any authority whatsoever to bind Sheba.xyz in any respect. All SERVICE PROVIDERs are independent contractors. Neither Sheba.xyz nor any users of the Website may direct or control the day-to-day activities of the other, or create or assume any obligation on behalf of the other.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("3. DISPUTES BETWEEN REGISTERED USERS")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            Subject to the provisions regarding disputes between Website participants in connection with Feedback, your interactions with individuals and/or organizations found on or through the Website, including payment of and performance of any Service, and any other terms, conditions, warranties or representations associated with such transactions or dealings, are solely between you and such individual or organization. You should take reasonable precautions and make whatever investigation or inquiries you deem necessary or appropriate before proceeding with any online or offline transaction with any third party, including without limitation, SERVICE PROVIDERs and SERVICE USERs\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            You understand that deciding whether to use the Services of a SERVICE PROVIDER or provide Services to a SERVICE USER or use information contained in any Submitted Content, including, without limitation, Postings, Offers, Wants and/or Feedback, is your personal decision for which alone are responsible. You understand that Sheba.xyz does not warrant and cannot make representations as to the suitability of any individual you may decide to interact with on or through the Website and/or the accuracy or suitability of any advice, information, or recommendations made by any individual. While Sheba.xyz may attempt to seek information about the background of a SERVICE PROVIDER, either via a telephonic or in-person interview, review of past work/customer feedback and/or check presence online (if available) on Facebook, personalised website, LinkedIn, Twitter etc., you understand that SERVICE PROVIDERs may register themselves sue moto. You also understand that any so called background check undertaken by Sheba.xyz is not exhaustive to the extent to determine previous criminal antecedents and hence, at the end of the day, the SERVICE USER should take an informed decision on his/her own accord and keep in mind the fact that Sheba.xyz only seeks to provide a platform wherein SERVICE USERs and SERVICE PROVIDERs have an opportunity to meet each other.\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            NOTWITHSTANDING THE FOREGOING, YOU AGREE THAT SINCE SHEBA.XYZ only seeks to provide a platform wherein the SERVICE USER and SERVICE PROVIDER can be brought together and Sheba.xyz itself has not role in the execution or provision of Services ITSELF, SHEBA.XYZ SHALL NOT BE RESPONSIBLE OR LIABLE FOR ANY LOSS OR DAMAGE OF ANY SORT WHATSOEVER INCURRED AS THE RESULT OF ANY SUCH TRANSACTION OR DEALINGS. IF THERE IS A DISPUTE BETWEEN PARTICIPANTS ON THE WEBSITE, OR BETWEEN REGISTERED USERS OR ANY WEBSITE USER AND ANY THIRD PARTY, YOU ACKNOWLEDGE AND AGREE THAT SHEBA.XYZ IS UNDER NO OBLIGATION TO BECOME INVOLVED. IN THE EVENT THAT A DISPUTE ARISES BETWEEN YOU AND ONE OR MORE WEBSITE USERS, REGISTERED USERS OR ANY THIRD PARTY, YOU HEREBY RELEASE SHEBA.XYZ, ITS OFFICERS, MANAGERS, MEMBERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, ATTORNEYS, AGENTS, AND SUCCESSORS IN RIGHTS FROM ANY CLAIMS, DEMANDS, AND DAMAGES (ACTUAL AND CONSEQUENTIAL) OF EVERY KIND OR NATURE, KNOWN OR UNKNOWN, SUSPECTED OR UNSUSPECTED, FORESEEABLE OR UNFORESEEABLE, DISCLOSED OR UNDISCLOSED, ARISING OUT OF OR IN ANY WAY RELATED TO SUCH DISPUTES AND/OR THE WEBSITE OR ANY SERVICE PROVIDED THEREUNDER.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h3",{staticClass:"secondary-header"},[e._v("L. Dispute Resolution")]),e._v(" "),s("hr")]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("p",[e._v("\n            If a dispute arises between you and Sheba.xyz, our goal is to provide you with a neutral and cost effective means of resolving the dispute quickly. Accordingly, you and Sheba.xyz hereby agree that we will resolve any claim or controversy at law and equity that arises out of the Terms of Use or the Website in accordance with this Section O or as we and you otherwise agree in writing. Before resorting to the filing of a formal lawsuit, we strongly encourage you to first contact us directly to seek a resolution via e-mail at info@sheba.xyz, or call at our call center on 16516. The dispute shall be resolved through alternative dispute resolution procedures, such as mediation or arbitration, as alternatives to litigation.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h4",[e._v("1. GOVERNING LAW")]),e._v(" "),s("p",[e._v("\n            The Terms of Use shall be governed in all respects by the laws of Bangladesh and any legal proceeding arising out of this Agreement will occur exclusively in the courts located in Dhaka, Bangladesh.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h3",{staticClass:"secondary-header"},[e._v("M. Advertisements")]),e._v(" "),s("hr")]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("p",[e._v("\n            Aspects of the Website and other Sheba.xyz services may be supported by advertising revenue. As such, Sheba.xyz may display advertisements and promotions on the service. The manner, mode and extent of advertising by Sheba.xyz on the Website are subject to change and the appearance of advertisements on the Website does not necessarily imply endorsement by Sheba.xyz of any advertised products or services. You agree that Sheba.xyz shall not be responsible or liable for any loss or damage of any sort incurred by you as a result of any such dealings or as the result of the presence of such advertisers on the Website.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h3",{staticClass:"secondary-header"},[e._v("N. Third-party Links, Contact Forms and Phone Numbers")]),e._v(" "),s("hr")]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("p",[e._v("\n            The Website may provide, or third parties may provide, links, contact forms and/or phone numbers to other\n            websites or resources, including, without limitation, social networking, blogging and similar websites\n            through which you are able to log into the Website using your existing account and log-in credentials for\n            such third-party websites. Certain areas of the Website may allow you to interact and/or conduct\n            transactions with such third-party sites, and, if applicable, allow you to configure your privacy\n            settings in your third-party site account to permit your activities on the Website to be shared\n            with your contacts in your third-party site account. Because Sheba.xyz has no control over such sites\n            and resources, you acknowledge and agree that Sheba.xyz is not responsible for the availability of such\n            external sites or resources, and is not responsible or liable for any content, advertising, products,\n            goods or services on or available from such websites or resources. Unless expressly stated on the Website,\n            links to third-party sites should in no way be considered as or interpreted to be Sheba.xyz's endorsement\n            of such third-party sites or any product or service offered through them. You further acknowledge and\n            agree that Sheba.xyz shall not be responsible or liable, directly or indirectly, for any damage or\n            loss caused or alleged to be caused by or in connection with use of or reliance on any such content,\n            advertising, product, goods or services available on or through any such website or resource.\n            The Third-party website may have different privacy policies and terms and conditions\n            and business practices than Sheba.xyz. In certain situations, you may be transferred\n            to a Third-party website through a link or connected to a Third-party resource by a contact form or\n            phone but it may appear that you are still on this Website or transacting with Sheba.xyz.\n            In these situations, you acknowledge and agree that the Third-party website terms and conditions\n            and privacy policy apply in this situation. Your dealings and communications through the Website with any party other than Sheba.xyz are solely between you and such third party. Any complaints, concerns or questions you have relating to materials provided by third parties should be forwarded directly to the applicable third party.\n          ")]),e._v(" "),s("br"),e._v(" "),s("h4",[e._v("REFERRAL PROGRAM POLICY")]),e._v(" "),s("ol",{attrs:{type:"1"}},[s("li",[e._v(" Referrer will be benefited only after the order of new user(receiver) is served.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" Both Parties will get 200 BDT discount for successful reference.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" The reference amount 200 BDT will be divided into two parts. One reference code will be generated, quantity will be 2 and the amount will be 100 BDT for each quantity. ")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" Validity for each reference code for referrer is 1 month and new user for 3 months.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" Referrer will get reference code only when new user places an order worth 500 BDT or more.\n              If new user uses his first reference code and order amount is less than 500 BDT,\n              then referrer will get no benefits from this.\n            ")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" Referrer’s location can’t be same of User’s location.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" Referrer and user can’t order same service at same location at same time period.")])])]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("h3",{staticClass:"secondary-header"},[e._v("O. FRAUDULENT PROTECTION POLICY")]),e._v(" "),s("hr")]),e._v(" "),s("div",{staticClass:"col-md-12"},[s("p",[e._v("\n            To provide a safe and secure shopping experience, we regularly monitor transactions for fraudulent activity. In the event of detecting any suspicious activity, Sheba.xyz reserves the right to cancel all past, pending and future orders without any liability. S