)]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v("\n              User uses invalid email and phone no\n            ")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v("\n              Use of a special voucher not tagged to the email ID/phone number used.\n            ")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User at any point of time copy, alter, modify or distribute any part of the SHEBA.XYZ Product (including Website, Apps but not limited to) in any medium.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(' User use any automated system, including but not limited to, "robots," "spiders," "offline readers," "scrapers," etc., to access the Website for any purpose without Sheba.xyz\'s prior written approval.')]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User transmits more request messages to the Sheba.xyz servers, or any server of a Sheba.xyz subsidiary or affiliate, in a given period of time than a human can reasonably produce in the same period by using a conventional online web browser.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User Post any message, information which is in against of Country’s any rules & regulations.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" Customer refuses to pay for an order")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User or its representative not showed up or not communicated while delivering requested service")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User use different person's identity to avail service.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User demand and strict on refund/solution which is not justified or illogical by SHEBA.XYZ.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" Same user carry multiple identity to create account or place order.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User misuse any system BUG.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User order same service multiple times at same day or within shortest period.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User use same promo code multiple times at same day or within shortest period.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User refer another user at same location.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" Multiple User order service at same location at same day.")]),e._v(" "),s("li",[e._v(" User fails to pro